{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"calc2-lesson05","version":1,"title":"微分積分学続論II","subtitle":"第5回 · 行列指数関数と一様収束","scope":"微分積分学続論II 5.pdf、全10物理ページ。行列指数関数と一様収束。既存問題と重複する復習と長い証明の再現は出題しない。","sourceManifest":[{"file":"Kyoto_Univ/[2026後期木３]微分積分学続論II/授業資料/微分積分学続論II 5.pdf","sha256":"9fff46fcbee252769a35c46450ba80a14534245bced0cd467d9619aefd18fbb2","pageCount":10,"reviewedPages":[3,4,5,7,8,9],"method":"原資料の抽出テキストと該当ページ画像を確認し、数式・記号・適用条件を照らし合わせた。板書写真は原画像を目視した。"}],"questions":[{"id":"calc2-l05-q01","version":1,"prompt":"正方行列Aの指数関数eᴬは、どの級数で定義する？","answer":"\\(e^A=\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}A^k/k!\\)、A⁰=I。","criterion":"定数項が単位行列になるべき級数を言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"微分積分学続論II 5.pdf","page":3,"imageKey":"9fff46fcbee252769a35c46450ba80a14534245bced0cd467d9619aefd18fbb2:3"}],"promptHtml":"正方行列Aの指数関数eᴬは、どの級数で定義する？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>A</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^A=\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}A^k/k!</annotation></semantics></math></span>、A⁰=I。","criterionHtml":"定数項が単位行列になるべき級数を言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"calc2-l05-q02","version":1,"prompt":"定数行列Aについて、行列指数関数eᵗᴬのt微分は？","answer":"\\(\\frac{d}{dt}e^{tA}=Ae^{tA}\\)。","criterion":"Aを掛けた式と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"微分積分学続論II 5.pdf","page":4,"imageKey":"9fff46fcbee252769a35c46450ba80a14534245bced0cd467d9619aefd18fbb2:4"}],"promptHtml":"定数行列Aについて、行列指数関数eᵗᴬのt微分は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{d}{dt}e^{tA}=Ae^{tA}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"Aを掛けた式と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"calc2-l05-q03","version":1,"prompt":"関数列fnがfへ一様収束するとき、\\(\\varepsilon>0\\)に対する自然数Nは、点xによって変えてよい？","answer":"変えない。同じNで定義域のすべてのxに対して誤差をε未満にする。","criterion":"Nをxに依存せず選べると言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"微分積分学続論II 5.pdf","page":5,"imageKey":"9fff46fcbee252769a35c46450ba80a14534245bced0cd467d9619aefd18fbb2:5"}],"promptHtml":"関数列fnがfへ一様収束するとき、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span>に対する自然数Nは、点xによって変えてよい？","answerHtml":"変えない。同じNで定義域のすべてのxに対して誤差をε未満にする。","criterionHtml":"Nをxに依存せず選べると言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"calc2-l05-q04","version":1,"prompt":"連続関数列がある区間で関数fに一様収束するとき、fの連続性は？","answer":"fも連続。","criterion":"一様極限が連続性を保つと言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"微分積分学続論II 5.pdf","page":7,"imageKey":"9fff46fcbee252769a35c46450ba80a14534245bced0cd467d9619aefd18fbb2:7"}],"promptHtml":"連続関数列がある区間で関数fに一様収束するとき、fの連続性は？","answerHtml":"fも連続。","criterionHtml":"一様極限が連続性を保つと言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"calc2-l05-q05","version":1,"prompt":"閉区間[a,b]上の連続関数列fnがfへ一様収束する。極限と積分の順序は交換できる？","answer":"できる。\\(\\lim_n\\int_a^b f_n\\,dx=\\int_a^b f\\,dx\\)。","criterion":"一様収束の条件で交換できると言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"微分積分学続論II 5.pdf","page":7,"imageKey":"9fff46fcbee252769a35c46450ba80a14534245bced0cd467d9619aefd18fbb2:7"}],"promptHtml":"閉区間[a,b]上の連続関数列fnがfへ一様収束する。極限と積分の順序は交換できる？","answerHtml":"できる。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_n\\int_a^b f_n\\,dx=\\int_a^b f\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"一様収束の条件で交換できると言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"calc2-l05-q06","version":1,"prompt":"関数級数\\(\\sum_k f_k(x)\\)にワイエルシュトラスのM判定法を使う。どんな上界Mkを用意する？","answer":"全xで\\(\\lvert f_k(x)\\rvert\\leq M_k\\)かつ\\(\\sum_k M_k<\\infty\\)となる非負定数列。","criterion":"xに依存しない上界と、その総和の収束を言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"微分積分学続論II 5.pdf","page":8,"imageKey":"9fff46fcbee252769a35c46450ba80a14534245bced0cd467d9619aefd18fbb2:8"}],"promptHtml":"関数級数<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_k f_k(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span>にワイエルシュトラスのM判定法を使う。どんな上界Mkを用意する？","answerHtml":"全xで<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lvert f_k(x)\\rvert\\leq M_k</annotation></semantics></math></span>かつ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_k M_k&lt;\\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span>となる非負定数列。","criterionHtml":"xに依存しない上界と、その総和の収束を言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"calc2-l05-q07","version":1,"prompt":"行列指数関数の級数\\(\\sum_k t^kA^k/k!\\)は、tのどの範囲で一様絶対収束する？","answer":"任意の有界な閉区間で一様絶対収束する。","criterion":"有限区間ごとの一様絶対収束と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"微分積分学続論II 5.pdf","page":9,"imageKey":"9fff46fcbee252769a35c46450ba80a14534245bced0cd467d9619aefd18fbb2:9"}],"promptHtml":"行列指数関数の級数<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><msup><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_k t^kA^k/k!</annotation></semantics></math></span>は、tのどの範囲で一様絶対収束する？","answerHtml":"任意の有界な閉区間で一様絶対収束する。","criterionHtml":"有限区間ごとの一様絶対収束と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""}],"sourceImages":{"9fff46fcbee252769a35c46450ba80a14534245bced0cd467d9619aefd18fbb2:3":"./assets/sources/9fff46fcbee252769a35c46450ba80a14534245bced0cd467d9619aefd18fbb2-3.png","9fff46fcbee252769a35c46450ba80a14534245bced0cd467d9619aefd18fbb2:4":"./assets/sources/9fff46fcbee252769a35c46450ba80a14534245bced0cd467d9619aefd18fbb2-4.png","9fff46fcbee252769a35c46450ba80a14534245bced0cd467d9619aefd18fbb2:5":"./assets/sources/9fff46fcbee252769a35c46450ba80a14534245bced0cd467d9619aefd18fbb2-5.png","9fff46fcbee252769a35c46450ba80a14534245bced0cd467d9619aefd18fbb2:7":"./assets/sources/9fff46fcbee252769a35c46450ba80a14534245bced0cd467d9619aefd18fbb2-7.png","9fff46fcbee252769a35c46450ba80a14534245bced0cd467d9619aefd18fbb2:8":"./assets/sources/9fff46fcbee252769a35c46450ba80a14534245bced0cd467d9619aefd18fbb2-8.png","9fff46fcbee252769a35c46450ba80a14534245bced0cd467d9619aefd18fbb2:9":"./assets/sources/9fff46fcbee252769a35c46450ba80a14534245bced0cd467d9619aefd18fbb2-9.png"},"renderVersion":1}